_05), none of which are temporally downstream of 695. Conclusion: no genuine time-respecting cascade."}, "raw_final_response": "Both nodes are active, and a static (time-ignoring) path exists (695\u2013800\u2013933\u2013362\u20131495 via shared 2-hop nodes 274/933/1531), yet no time-respecting route exists at all \u2014 even with unlimited waiting.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_636b848d\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [695, 1495],\n  \"window\": [28025, 66424],\n  \"confidence\": 0.9,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"With the 600-unit relay constraint, 695 reaches only 2 nodes and never 1495 (step_01). Relaxing the constraint entirely still fails: 695 reaches 588 nodes in time-respecting fashion but 1495 is not among them (step_02), and the reverse direction also fails (step_06). This rules out the max_wait threshold as the reason for failure \u2014 the ordering of events itself blocks influence. Both nodes are genuinely active in the window (5 and 4 events, step_04), so the negative result is not a data-absence artifact, though their low degree means they are peripheral rather than popular hubs. Critically, an undirected/static connection does exist: the 2-hop neighbourhoods of 695 (step_03) and 1495 (step_07) share nodes 274, 933 and 1531, giving static paths such as 695\u2013800\u2013933\u2013362\u20131495. That static link is precisely the confound the task warns about, and it is not matched by any temporal ordering. 1495's only contacts are 362, 701, 702, 1517 (step_05), none of which are temporally downstream of 695. Conclusion: no genuine time-respecting cascade.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 26470, "total_output_tokens": 2050, "total_tokens": 28520, "total_latency_ms": 33399, "llm_calls": 4, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}